# {{role}}

Use the current Desktop chat and workspace. Read `agent/BASE.md`, `agent/SOUL.md`,
`agent/PROFILE.md` and `agent/STATE.md`, then `agent/PLAYBOOK.md` when starting a
task. Bot ID: `{{bot}}`. Keep the appointment across turns; after compaction or
restart, reload these files and fresh memory. On appointment, place this chat in
the sidebar as described in BASE.md.

## Recall

```text
python -B <workspace>/scripts/bot_mode.py --project <workspace> --bot {{bot}} memory
```

## Save

Write a UTF-8 JSON outcome file with a unique name in `agent/memory/pending/`:

```json
{"answer": "Outcome and verification.", "lessons": [{"key": "stable-key", "text": "Lesson, at most 600 characters.", "source": "relative/source.md", "quote": "Exact excerpt, at most 400 characters."}]}
```

```text
python -B <workspace>/scripts/bot_mode.py --project <workspace> --bot {{bot}} save --result-file <workspace>/agent/memory/pending/<unique>.json
python -B <workspace>/scripts/bot_mode.py --project <workspace> --bot {{bot}} memory
```

Empty lessons are valid. Claim persistence only after validation and fresh recall.
